{"seq":2,"slug":"geofence-eta-transit-visibility","title":"地理围栏与在途 ETA 可视化：GPS 融合、场站围栏与到达时间预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/geofence-eta-transit-visibility","wordCount":3016,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"地理围栏与在途-eta-可视化-gps-融合-场站围栏与到达时间预测\">地理围栏与在途 ETA 可视化：GPS 融合、场站围栏与到达时间预测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在途可视性的本质，是把连续、含噪的定位点翻译成离散、可信的业务事件，再用这些事件算出&quot;车何时到达&quot;。它由四个串行环节构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定位融合</strong>——把车机、手机、ELD 三类来源统一为带精度标注的轨迹；</li>\n<li><strong>场站围栏</strong>——用分层多边形判定&quot;进入码头/闸口/堆区&quot;的几何事实；</li>\n<li><strong>ETA 预测</strong>——把剩余行程拆成行驶、排队、闸口、场内四段估算；</li>\n<li><strong>异常识别</strong>——对偏航、长停留与失联做实时判定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文承接 <a href=\"../drayage-network-operating-model/drayage-network-topology-actors\">短驳网络拓扑与参与方角色</a> 的责任分层：定位数据本身不产生责任，只有它锚定的闸口事件才产生责任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途可视性的数据底座-三类定位源及其可信度差异\">在途可视性的数据底座：三类定位源及其可信度差异</h2><p>短驳的每一单都有一个&quot;现在到哪了&quot;的问题，而定位源在精度、频率与合规性上并不等价。第一类是<strong>车队自有车机终端（telematics gateway）</strong>，典型供应商包括 Samsara、Motive（原 KeepTruckin）、Geotab 与 Platform Science，以 10–60 秒粒度上报经纬度、速度与 OBD 数据，是 ETA 推算的主数据源。第二类是<strong>司机手机端 App</strong>，成本为零、部署快，但精度受电量优化钳制——iOS 的 Core Location 在后台按系统判断降频，Android 各厂商后台限制更大，城区采样间隔可能从 5 秒跳到 90 秒。第三类是<strong>电子记录装置（ELD）</strong>，其法定身份是合规设备而非定位设备：美国 FMCSA 依据 49 CFR Part 395 Subpart B 的 ELD 强制规则要求装置在车辆运动中按 60 分钟间隔记录，并在变点（换班、驾驶状态切换）时补充记录，2017 年 12 月起多数州际承运人已被强制装配。用 60 分钟粒度做分钟级 ETA 不成立，ELD 只能作为<strong>事件锚点</strong>；结论是<strong>主数据源选车机，手机端断链兜底，ELD 只做状态校验</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定位源</th>\n<th>典型采样粒度</th>\n<th>精度（CEP）</th>\n<th>合规/设备属性</th>\n<th>在 ETA 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>车队车机（Samsara/Motive 等）</td>\n<td>10–60 秒</td>\n<td>5–15 m</td>\n<td>私有遥测设备</td>\n<td>主轨迹源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>司机手机 App</td>\n<td>5–90 秒（系统动态）</td>\n<td>10–50 m</td>\n<td>消费级设备</td>\n<td>断链兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ELD</td>\n<td>60 分钟 + 变点</td>\n<td>10–30 m</td>\n<td>FMCSA 49 CFR 395</td>\n<td>状态/换班锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>码头闸口 OCR/雷达</td>\n<td>事件触发</td>\n<td>车道级</td>\n<td>MTO 自有</td>\n<td>到达事实基准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从单点定位到可信位置-卡尔曼滤波与轨迹清洗\">从单点定位到可信位置：卡尔曼滤波与轨迹清洗</h2><p>原始 GPS 点直接用来判定&quot;是否到达场站&quot;会高频误报：城市峡谷、堆场高箱林立、龙门吊钢结构都会造成多径反射，使一个静止的卡车在坐标上&quot;抖动&quot;十几米。标准做法是对位置序列做<strong>状态估计</strong>而非取原始值。以匀速模型为例，状态向量取位置与速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_k = [p_x, p_y, v_x, v_y]^T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1274em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，过程与观测方程为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_k = F x_{k-1} + w_k,\\qquad z_k = H x_k + v_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=