://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为只观测位置的观测矩阵。卡尔曼增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><msup><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><msup><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_k = P_k^- H^T (H P_k^- H^T + R)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1426em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定系统更相信预测还是当前观测：当上报的 <code>accuracy_m</code> 很大（堆场内常见 30–80 m）时应动态放大观测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，使输出更依赖历史运动。第二个清洗动作是<strong>地图匹配（map matching）</strong>，把稀疏轨迹吸附到路网图：主流方案基于隐马尔可夫模型（HMM），经典形式由 Newson 与 Krumm 于 2009 年提出（ACM SIGSPATIAL，&quot;Hidden Markov Map Matching Through Noise and Sparseness&quot;）。Google 的 Roads API <code>snapToRoads</code>、TomTom 与 HERE 的 Matching API 提供托管版，开源侧有 Valhalla Meili 与 OSRM <code>match</code>——托管方案会把完整轨迹发给第三方，须按数据边界决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场站围栏建模-为什么圆形围栏在港口会失效\">场站围栏建模：为什么圆形围栏在港口会失效</h2><p>移动端最省事的圆形围栏有硬上限——iOS 的 <code>CLCircularRegion</code> 单应用监控约 20 个区域，Android 的 Geofencing API 约 100 个，超出即静默失效。但港口场站几乎从不是圆形：码头是被闸口、堆区、空箱区、危险品区与铁路线切割的巨大多边形，且不同区域对&quot;到达&quot;的定义完全不同——<strong>进入港区道路不等于进入闸口排队区，进入排队区不等于完成闸入</strong>。用一个大圆覆盖整座码头，会把&quot;在港区外围等红绿灯&quot;误判成&quot;已到达&quot;，污染 ETA 与到达准时率（OTP）。正确的建模是<strong>分层多边形围栏 + 语义角色</strong>：货主/仓库围栏（取送货点）、码头外围缓冲围栏（&quot;即将到达&quot;预提醒）、闸口专用围栏（贴合进闸车道、宽度仅十几米，产生精确闸前时刻）、堆区/箱区围栏（校验司机停在正确提箱位）。几何用 GeoJSON <code>Polygon</code>（RFC 7946 标准）持久化到 PostGIS 的 <code>GEOGRAPHY</code> 类型，判定用 <code>ST_Contains</code>、对圆形用 <code>ST_DWithin</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[车机/手机定位点&lt;br/&gt;10-60s 上报] --&gt; B[卡尔曼滤波&lt;br/&gt;平滑位置与速度]&#10;    B --&gt; C[地图匹配&lt;br/&gt;HMM/托管 API 吸附路网]&#10;    C --&gt; D{分层围栏判定&lt;br/&gt;PostGIS ST_Contains}&#10;    D --&gt;|进入缓冲围栏| E[触发即将到达&lt;br/&gt;推送 ETA 更新]&#10;    D --&gt;|进入闸口围栏| F[产生闸前事件&lt;br/&gt;冻结 ETA 为排队模型]&#10;    D --&gt;|进入堆区围栏| G[校验提箱位置&lt;br/&gt;异常则告警]&#10;    F --&gt; H[闸口事件与 EDI&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证去重]&#10;    H --&gt; I[推进箱状态机&lt;br/&gt;驱动后续派单]\">graph TD\n    A[车机/手机定位点&lt;br/&gt;10-60s 上报] --&gt; B[卡尔曼滤波&lt;br/&gt;平滑位置与速度]\n    B --&gt; C[地图匹配&lt;br/&gt;HMM/托管 API 吸附路网]\n    C --&gt; D{分层围栏判定&lt;br/&gt;PostGIS ST_Contains}\n    D --&gt;|进入缓冲围栏| E[触发即将到达&lt;br/&gt;推送 ETA 更新]\n    D --&gt;|进入闸口围栏| F[产生闸前事件&lt;br/&gt;冻结 ETA 为排队模型]\n    D --&gt;|进入堆区围栏| G[校验提箱位置&lt;br/&gt;异常则告警]\n    F --&gt; H[闸口事件与 EDI&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证去重]\n    H --&gt; I[推进箱状态机&lt;br/&gt;驱动后续派单]</pre><p>几何围栏的隐性成本是<strong>几何漂移</strong>：码头会因施工、堆场重划、闸口改道改变物理布局，一个 2024 年画的闸口多边形到 2026 年可能已偏移数十米。因此围栏不能硬编码进客户端，必须走<strong>服务端下发 + 版本号</strong>——服务端更新时递增版本，客户端下次上报携带版本号，服务端据此决定是否全量重推。这与 <a href=\"../terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约窗口配额模型</a> 同构：码头资源外生且随时间变化，必须当配置输入而非常量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eta-预测-把-剩余路程-拆成四段时间\">ETA 预测：把&quot;剩余路程&quot;拆成四段时间</h2><p>短驳行程里路上行驶往往只占一半时间，另一半消耗在排队、闸口与场内寻箱上，所以 ETA 应显式拆成四段：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ETA</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>drive</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gate</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>in-yard</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ETA} = t_{\\text{now}} + T_{\\text{drive}} + T_{\\text{queue}} + T_{\\text{gate}} + T_{\\text{in-yard}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ETA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-yard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>drive</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{drive}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是沿匹配后路网到目标围栏的行驶时间，取自路由引擎（HERE、TomTom、Google 或自建 OSRM/Valhalla）并结合实时交通流；开源 OSRM 基于 OpenStreetMap 做多对多矩阵计算，成本低但对实时拥堵不敏感，需叠加自有历史速度剖面。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是闸口排队时间，也是短驳 ETA 里最不可预测、最有价值的一项——其本质是码头当前<strong>在途卡车数 ÷ 闸口服务率</strong>的排队问题，可用 M/M/c 或对历史闸口事件的到达间隔做经验分布估计。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{gate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单次闸口手续时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>in-yard</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{in-yard}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-yard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是场内寻箱与吊装时间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是自建系统的护城河：它依赖本系统对<strong>闸口事件的持续采集</strong>——每当一辆车跨越闸口围栏，系统就得到一个排队时间样本，按小时 × 星期 × 码头入库后即可用分位数而非均值给出 ETA 区间。给出区间而非单点值是关键决策，因为预约窗口容错通常只有几十分钟。DCSA 的 Track &amp; Trace 标准把事件组织为 Shipment、Transport、Equipment、IoT、Reefer 五类，其中 Equipment 事件明确包含闸入（gate-in）、闸出（gate-out）等时刻（来源：DCSA, Track &amp; Trace 标准）——它们既是 ETA 的校准标签，也是状态机推进的触发源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到达事件与状态机-把定位流翻译成业务事件\">到达事件与状态机：把定位流翻译成业务事件</h2><p>定位流本身不是业务语义，系统必须定义<strong>从几何到事件</strong>的翻译规则才能驱动派单状态机。最小事件集是四个：<code>arrived_at_buffer</code>（进入缓冲围栏）、<code>arrived_at_gate</code>（进入闸口围栏并停留超过阈值）、<code>entered_terminal</code>（闸入，通常由码头 EDI/API 确认）、<code>departed_terminal</code>（闸出）。关键设计点是<strong>去抖动与停留判定</strong>：车辆在闸口前因红灯或堵车短暂进入围栏又退出，不应产生&quot;到达&quot;事件；通行做法是要求持续停留超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>dwell</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{dwell}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dwell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 90 秒）且速度低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{stop}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 2 km/h）才确认。第二个设计点是<strong>多源交叉验证</strong>：同一闸入事实可能同时来自车机围栏判定、码头方 EDI 214 报文、以及预约平台 API 推送（如 eModal，由 Advent Intermodal Solutions 运营），三者时间戳可能相差数分钟；工程上应定义<strong>权威优先级</strong>（码头方事件为事实基准、围栏判定为提示），并用去重键（箱号 + 事件类型 + 时间窗 + 来源）去重。状态机还承担一个易被忽视的职责——<strong>防止幽灵完成</strong>：一旦设备离线或司机拔掉终端，系统会看到一辆&quot;永远在路上&quot;的车，因此每个到达事件都应有时效窗口，窗口内既无围栏事件也无码头事件时必须转入待人工核实状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常检测-偏航-长停留与失联的工程化识别\">异常检测：偏航、长停留与失联的工程化识别</h2><p>在途可视的另一半价值是<strong>主动发现异常</strong>。第一类是<strong>偏航（route deviation）</strong>：车辆离开前往目标码头的合理路径，检测方式是判断&quot;当前点到目标围栏的最短路耗时&quot;是否较基线显著上升，或当前点与规划路径的横向距离是否越阈。第二类是<strong>异常长停留（unexpected dwell）</strong>：车辆停在非围栏区域超过阈值（如 15 分钟），可能意味抛锚、事故或私下装卸。第三类是<strong>失联（signal loss）</strong>：定位源长时间无上报，需区分设备故障、隧道遮挡还是司机人为断开。三类异常都依赖同一基础能力——<strong>在途轨迹的实时流处理</strong>：定位点进入消息管道（Kafka 或 MQTT 是常见选择），经清洗、匹配、围栏判定后产出事件，再进入规则引擎做阈值与模式匹配。该管道对延迟敏感，闸前 5 分钟的到达预告若晚到 10 分钟就毫无价值，因此围栏判定必须在<strong>边缘或近实时层</strong>完成；异常事件还要能回溯到原始定位点，其保留期限与访问边界须在设计期定好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地权衡-成本-合规与可观测性\">落地权衡：成本、合规与可观测性</h2><p><strong>第一是定位频率与成本</strong>：上报频率翻倍意味着终端流量与云端存储近乎翻倍，而短驳单程通常只有 30–120 分钟，60 秒粒度对多数场景已足够，仅在接近目标围栏的最后 5 公里切到 10–15 秒高频。<strong>第二是托管 API 与自建</strong>：托管服务开箱即用但按调用计费且把轨迹送出边界，自建（OSRM/Valhalla + 自有历史速度）前期投入大但边际成本低且数据不出境——跨境场景下轨迹常带可识别性，是否出境须在设计期回答。<strong>第三是可观测性</strong>：ETA 准不准必须有量化指标，标准做法是对<strong>每次到达事件的预测误差分布</strong>做监控，例如以&quot;预测到达时刻与闸口实际时刻的绝对误差 ≤ 15 分钟的比例&quot;作为服务等级，并按码头、时段、司机分桶观察；缺少反馈闭环时，任何 ETA 模型都会在码头班表变更后长期失准，例如洛杉矶/长滩港由 WCMTOA 发布的 OffPeak 班表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>围栏、路由、ETA 与异常检测不是四个独立功能，而是同一条&quot;定位 → 位置 → 事件 → 决策&quot;链路上的四段。定位融合决定位置可信度，围栏建模决定事件是否精准，ETA 拆解决定时间是否可用，异常检测决定链路是否可信。任何一段可信度不足，整条链路给出的到达时间都不能用于调度决策；四段共享同一数据姿态——闸口事件是事实基准，其余皆为提示，这既是技术选择，也是滞箱费争议中证据链成立的前提。调度侧前置设计见 <a href=\"dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow\">派单分派与司机作业流</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地理围栏与在途 ETA 可视化：GPS 融合、场站围栏与到达时间预测","id":"地理围栏与在途-eta-可视化-gps-融合-场站围栏与到达时间预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"在途可视性的数据底座：三类定位源及其可信度差异","id":"在途可视性的数据底座-三类定位源及其可信度差异"},{"level":2,"text":"从单点定位到可信位置：卡尔曼滤波与轨迹清洗","id":"从单点定位到可信位置-卡尔曼滤波与轨迹清洗"},{"level":2,"text":"场站围栏建模：为什么圆形围栏在港口会失效","id":"场站围栏建模-为什么圆形围栏在港口会失效"},{"level":2,"text":"ETA 预测：把\"剩余路程\"拆成四段时间","id":"eta-预测-把-剩余路程-拆成四段时间"},{"level":2,"text":"到达事件与状态机：把定位流翻译成业务事件","id":"到达事件与状态机-把定位流翻译成业务事件"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测：偏航、长停留与失联的工程化识别","id":"异常检测-偏航-长停留与失联的工程化识别"},{"level":2,"text":"落地权衡：成本、合规与可观测性","id":"落地权衡-成本-合规与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"派单分配与司机作业流：任务派发、接单确认与到场签到闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow"},"next":{"title":"滞留、甩柜与放箱失败：短驳异常事件的检测、分级与处置流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/detention-rollover-exception-handling"}}